:: LaaB V0.04.00

=Life as a Boy V0.04.00 "Adults & Arousal Update Changelog"=

=Adult Sprites=
-Adults sprites have been created and added for the following NPCs: Player's Father, Headmaster Alistair, Mr. Randolph, Mr. De Leon, Mr. Julien, Mr. Chang, Mr. Hart, & Coach Kohler.
-Scenes including the character have had the avatars added into them.

=Customizable Bedrooms=
You can now customize your Player's Bedroom to suit their tastes. The following customizations have been added:
-Bed (15 Color Options)
-Bedside Lamp (15 Color Options)
-Curtains (15 Color Options + None)
-Desk Lamp (15 Color Options)
-Desk Chair (15 Color Options)
-Floor (13 Carpet, 4 Hardwood)
-Left Wall (Shelf or None)
-Left Wall Shelf Item (1)
-Right Wall (Shelf or None)
-Center Item (2 Toybox Options)
-Walls (15 Color Options)

=Foreplay=
-Foreplay images now appear as a toggleable option during Lucas Foreplay which depict the position chosen. These account for Position, Top/Bottom, and Hard Penis for Partner(in some cases). For a total of 14 possible images.

=Xavier=
-New Quest "Collections" (2-Part Quest starting After School.)

=Jackson=
-New Quest "Parental Drama" (3-Part Quest starting at the Mall.)

=New Sprites=
-New Hair: Long Spiky, Curtains (Thanks to Ron, Oni, & Koala!)
-New clothing: Wrestling Singlet, Wrestling Headgear, Boy Shorts, Petal Boy Shorts, Stripped Panties, Color Seamed Panties, Red Punk Jeans(Updated)

=Other Changes & Additions=
-You can now cook in the Kitchen again.

